{"data": [{"author_id": "6374602", "created_at": "2026-11-09T20:37:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119892213022982417"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "General statements are information shared with the public that was not addressed by an official press release. All issued press releases are posted separately on our Press Release page.Statements related to General Aviation incidents may be found on our Accidents and Incidents page.News media with questions on other topics may contact us at pressoffice@faa.gov.", "display_url": "faa.gov/newsroom/state…", "end": 221, "expanded_url": "https://www.faa.gov/newsroom/statements/general-statements", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117358869383172096/z8kcucfY?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117358869383172096/z8kcucfY?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 198, "status": 200, "title": "FAA General Statements", "unwound_url": "https://www.faa.gov/newsroom/statements/general-statements", "url": "https://t.co/O9u0tDRVmX"}]}, "id": "2119892213022982417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 987, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "The FAA noted in a brief statement today about issuing a reentry license for Sierra Space's Dream Chaser that it is doing so \"well in advance of Sierra Space’s targeted spring 2027 mission date.\" \n\nhttps://t.co/O9u0tDRVmX", "url": "https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2119892213022982417"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:36:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119876752071692398"], "id": "2119876752071692398", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3019, "like_count": 103, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "My overwhelming takeaway from the Douthat-Trump interview is that Trump is definitely not senile, and in fact very much still h