w", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119797154218738172"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:45:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119788394918404459"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lefineder/stat…", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lefineder/status/2119740253481152667", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/1L77YFOZ6y"}]}, "id": "2119788394918404459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1579, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119740253481152667", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ON THE OTHER HAND\n\nperhaps the greatest wifeguy energy in the history exists in the form of the Laudatio Turiae \n\nsocieties contain varieties! https://t.co/1L77YFOZ6y", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119788394918404459"}, {"author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-11-09T09:58:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119731262248132963"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/F20mdNG57P", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2119731262248132963/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119730952662315008", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/F20mdNG57P"}]}, "id": "2119731262248132963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 14371, "like_count": 193, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 35}, "text": "Three years of the Zero Debris Charter!\n\nMore than 250 signatories from 36 countries are now working towards a zero debris future by 2030, with confidence growing that the technical targets can be achieved, and new members joining last week in Brasília. \n\nRead more: https://t.co/F20mdNG57P", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2119731262248132963"}, {"author_id": "610659001", "created_at": "2026-11-09T08:42:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119712175782510862"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jrdXaIfoJA", "end": 99, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MaxCRo